  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Aaseya Inspection Solution Connector (Pega)",
    "splashDescription": "The Aaseya Inspection Solution streamlines scheduling, execution, and reporting of inspections, offering flexibility for field and on-site processes. It provides a comprehensive audit trail, ensuring continual audit readiness for compliance purposes. This versatile tool reduces risk, ensures compliance, and has extensive applications across various industries. The Aaseya Inspection Solution Connector enables seamless integration between the Aaseya Inspection Solution, which is built on top of Pegasystems, with Camunda. With this Connector, your Camunda-based business processes can trigger actions and exchange information between the two systems, achieving end-to-end process automation and enhanced user experiences.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/449683/overview/img4367707617721815813.png?a9007af5b79d2b10938faa5eb4e6f850",
